            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-center mb-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 h-full flex flex-col justify-center">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-emerald-600 text-lg"><span lang="es">Macrociclo</span><span lang="en">Macrocycle</span></h4>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2">
                        <span lang="es"><strong>Ciclo a Largo Plazo</strong><br>(Varios meses a 1 Año)</span>
                        <span lang="en"><strong>Long Term Cycle</strong><br>(Several months to 1 Year)</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-2 italic bg-slate-50 p-2 rounded">
                        <span lang="es">Ej: Tu curso completo de 1º de Bachillerato o la temporada de un atleta para las Olimpiadas.</span>
