            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 mb-4">
                <span lang="es">Magnitudes de la Carga (¿Cuánto y a qué nivel entrenamos?)</span>
                <span lang="en">Load Magnitudes (How much and at what level do we train?)</span>
            </h3>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-4">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <span lang="es">Volumen <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">(Cantidad)</span></span>
                        <span lang="en">Volume <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">(Quantity)</span></span>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                        <span lang="es">Representa la cantidad total de trabajo realizado. Es el aspecto cuantitativo.</span>
                        <span lang="en">Represents the total amount of work done. It is the quantitative aspect.</span>
                    </p>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3 space-y-1 list-disc pl-4">
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>En Resistencia:</strong> Tiempo (ej. 45 min) o Distancia (ej. 10 Km).</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>In Endurance:</strong> Time (e.g., 45 min) or Distance (e.g., 10 Km).</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>En Fuerza:</strong> Series $\times$ Repeticiones $\times$ Peso (ej. 3 series de 10 reps con 20kg).</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>In Strength:</strong> Sets $\times$ Reps $\times$ Weight (e.g., 3 sets of 10 reps with 20kg).</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="border-l-4 border-red-500 pl-4">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <span lang="es">Intensidad <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">(Calidad)</span></span>
                        <span lang="en">Intensity <span class="text-xs font-normal text-slate-500">(Quality)</span></span>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                        <span lang="es">Representa el grado de esfuerzo, la rapidez o dificultad del trabajo. Es el aspecto cualitativo.</span>
                        <span lang="en">Represents the degree of effort, speed, or difficulty of the work. It is the qualitative aspect.</span>
                    </p>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3 space-y-1 list-disc pl-4">
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>En Resistencia:</strong> Ritmo (ej. 5 min/km), Velocidad (ej. 12 km/h) o Frecuencia Cardíaca (ej. 160 ppm).</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>In Endurance:</strong> Pace (e.g., 5 min/km), Speed (e.g., 12 km/h) or Heart Rate (e.g., 160 bpm).</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>En Fuerza:</strong> % del Peso Máximo (1RM) o Percepción de Esfuerzo (RPE/RIR).</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>In Strength:</strong> % of Maximum Weight (1RM) or Rate of Perceived Exertion (RPE/RIR).</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-4">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">
                        <span lang="es">Recuperación / Densidad</span>
                        <span lang="en">Recovery / Density</span>
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
                        <span lang="es">El tiempo de descanso entre estímulos para regenerar (pausa).</span>
                        <span lang="en">The rest time between stimuli to regenerate (pause).</span>
                    </p>
                    <ul class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-3 space-y-1 list-disc pl-4">
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>Activa:</strong> Caminar suave o pedalear lento (ayuda a reciclar ácido láctico).</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>Active:</strong> Light walking or slow pedaling (helps recycle lactic acid).</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>Pasiva:</strong> Parar por completo o sentarse.</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>Passive:</strong> Stopping completely or sitting down.</span>
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span lang="es"><strong>Densidad:</strong> Relación entre el tiempo trabajando y descansando (ej. trabajar 1 min y descansar 1 min).</span>
                            <span lang="en"><strong>Density:</strong> Ratio between working time and resting time (e.g., work 1 min, rest 1 min).</span>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

